<tr><td data-th="">When a model or price changes</td><td data-th="Without one">Something breaks quietly</td><td data-th="One that doesn’t work">Nothing changes, or a rewrite</td><td data-th="One that works">Tested, then adopted or rejected on evidence</td></tr>
</tbody>
